# Spotify — powers the "Tune In" playlists on the homepage.
#
# Client Credentials flow: an app-level token, no user login, no refresh token.
# Reads PUBLIC playlists only, which is all that section shows.
#
# Get these from https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard (your app > Settings).
# No redirect URI is needed — that is only used by the Authorization Code flow.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill both in. Without them the build still
# succeeds and the section falls back to the snapshot in utils/playlists.json,
# so a missing value fails quietly — set them in Vercel too, or production
# will keep serving stale track counts.

SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET=
